{
  "ruleId": "DED-AGNIVEER-GOVERNMENT",
  "_note": "The Central Government's contribution: \"Where the Central Government makes any contribution to the account of an assessee in the Fund referred to in sub-section (1), the assessee shall be allowed a deduction in the computation of his total income of the whole of the amount so contributed\" (s.125(2), p.161) — the whole amount, base AMOUNT_PAID; the same contribution is salary (s.16(l), p.38), so the two net to nil. Every regime: s.202(2)(a)(xii) keeps s.125(2) (p.227). TY 2026-27 only; the 1961 counterpart, s.80CCH, is unread (W-075d). rulebook DED-AGNIVEER-001. D-140.",
